Pangopup GENCODE v38 splice-mask attribution

domains.pgm is Pangopup's transformed, compact runtime representation of
splice-domain facts derived from the archived GENCODE release 38 comprehensive
gene annotation for GRCh38:

https://ftp.ebi.ac.uk/pub/databases/gencode/Gencode_human/release_38/gencode.v38.annotation.gtf.gz
SHA-256: 22020df0d3356e965868f4b193e89fa13e838b950a574349f7fcd461ac01c050
GENCODE release page: https://www.gencodegenes.org/human/release_38.html
Data access: https://www.gencodegenes.org/pages/data_access.html
Citation guidance: https://www.gencodegenes.org/pages/citing_gencode.html

The transformation retains the ordered Ensembl-canonical gene and exon
boundaries needed by Pangolin-compatible masking. Pangopup does not redistribute
the source GTF or the intermediate gffutils SQLite database in this transport.

GENCODE data are provided by the GENCODE project. See the release page for the
upstream project's terms and attribution information.
